%I A399363 #13 Sep 03 2026 21:35:17
%S A399363 0,1,2,5,14,50,233,1249,7594,49565
%N A399363 The number of 3-connected cubic planar graphs on 2n-4 vertices that can be strongly embedded on the Klein bottle.
%C A399363 By a theorem of Weiß and Niemeyer, such an embedding exists if and only if the dual graph of the given graph contains specific subgraphs. The numbers were computed using GAP.
%H A399363 Meike Weiß, <a href="https://github.com/gap-packages/SimplicialSurfaces">GAP Code</a>.
%H A399363 Meike Weiß and Alice C. Niemeyer, <a href="https://dmtcs.episciences.org/19018">Strong Embeddings of 3-Connected Cubic Planar Graphs on Surfaces of non-negative Euler Characteristic</a>, Discrete Mathematics & Theoretical Computer Science, 2026.
%Y A399363 Cf. A399361 (on the projective plane), A399362 (on the torus).
%K A399363 nonn,more,new
%O A399363 4,3
%A A399363 _Meike Weiß_, Aug 27 2026
